[sub_resource type="RoseDialogLine" id="RoseDialogLine_o2yrl"]
text = "Huh? Weren't you the one who told me? It was Grand Master Golem. Take down notes if you're going to forget again! Anyway, you can probably get a Mana Charger from {fc=12}Grand Master Golem{/fc}. Get it and bring it to me."
